What request does `call.prepare()` build? Give `method`, `url`, `headers` (only the ones Concord sets; secret values as `<secret>`), `body`, `content_type` and `accept`.

```rust
let api = SlackApi::new(reqwest::Client::new(), SlackApiConfig {
    token: "CANARYSLACK1Z".into(),
});
let call = api.users_list(29).set_include_locale(false).set_team_id("x&y=z");
```

